# Anti-patterns

Full list: [`docs/anti-patterns.md`](../../docs/anti-patterns.md)

Reject PRs that reintroduce:

- React/Babel → Latte transpile
- `data-slot` → semantic CSS extractor
- Parallel UI kits as second codegen
- Hand-edit of `.workspaces/ui8kit-latte`, `themes/wp-fasty/ui8kit`, `themes/wp-fasty/twig/ui8kit`
- Variant recipes hardcoded in views instead of `kit()`
- WP API calls inside Latte
- Shipping codegen TS in theme zips
- Controlled React-style `open` with `behavior="ui8kit"`
- Twin/hand-copied variant maps
- Treating experimental/dirty theme views as the design system (use `themes/wp-fasty`)
